<div class="p-4" style="text-align: left;">
  <p>We have detected a billing issue affecting <%= @sku_string %> on your organization account, <%= @org.display_login %>.</p>
  <p>Until you take action to address the billing issue, you cannot enable <%= @sku_string %> features on any new private repositories. Existing features on current repositories will not be affected.</p>
  <p>Please review and update your billing settings or contact GitHub Support if you need assistance.</p>
</div>

<% if @billing_access %>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 25px 0;">
    <a href="<%= GitHub.url %>/organizations/<%= @org.display_login %>/settings/billing/summary" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 24px; font-size: 16px; color: #ffffff; background-color: #2da44e; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500;">Billing Settings</a>
  </div>
<% end %>

<div style="margin-top: 40px; color: #6e7781; font-size: 12px;">
  <p><%= @footer %></p>
</div>
